WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Coming from Newark
and being a mayor,

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.871
where you´re actually connected,
I think,

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:07.640
you know, to a place more
than senators can be sometimes,

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.242
´cause they´re in and out.

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:10.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were just in --
You were in Newark.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:12.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were living
and breathing in Newark.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
And gun control --

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just co-sponsored a bill
to ban bump stocks.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.818
But I think your experience
in Newark is that handguns

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.988
are still the biggest issue
when it comes to gun control.

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:24.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
What are the steps,
as someone who actually,

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:26.626
you know, lived in a city
where that was an issue,

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you think
we could take as a nation?

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.964 size:78% position:39%
-Well, I very proudly
still live in Newark,

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:33.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I live in the Central Ward
of the city.

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.335
It´s a low-income community.

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:37.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we deal with
these realities.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:40.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
In fact, as trag--

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
What happened in Las Vegas --
my mom lives in Vegas --

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:46.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s a terrible tragedy,
and it should grieve us all.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:49.382 size:88% position:44%
But in addition to that,
though in the aggregate,

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:51.217
every single day in America,

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
we have a mass shooting,
in the aggregate.

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
And communities like mine,
you know,

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.223 size:78% position:39%
right around the time

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we had this shooting,
horrific shooting --

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
In fact one of
our congresspeople

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:04.364
got seriously wounded, there
was a shooting on my block,

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:06.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
literally across the street
from where I live.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
So this is something
we Americans --

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:10.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
Millions of us
deal every single day

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.838
with high levels of violence.

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:13.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what I found out
in Newark is

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
it´s actually not
law-abiding citizens

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:16.643
that are doing these shootings.

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:19.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
They are criminals
who so easily in this climate

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
can easily
get their hands on guns.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:25.485
And so when you have these
massive loopholes in the law

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:27.320
that Democrats and Republicans,

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
gun owners and non-gun owners,
all think --

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:31.458
In fact, over 80% of gun owners
think it´s crazy

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:34.094
that we live in a nation
where a suspected terrorist

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:37.497
can go to a gun show and fill up
a trunk full of weapons

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:39.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
by exploiting
the terrorist loophole.

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
The overwhelming majority
of Americans think

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.436
we should do something about it.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.306 size:84% position:42%
Congress has not acted,
and this is outrageous.

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:48.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we should rightfully
point out the NRA.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:51.311 size:78% position:39%
But please understand
that we in America,

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:54.013
we forget the power that we have
to make change.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
the Civil Rights movement --

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
We didn´t get
civil-rights legislation

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:58.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
because Strom Thurmond
sat there and said,

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Okay, yeah.
I´m going to do that.

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:02.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m going to give
equal rights to folks."

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:06.126 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, it was Americans
demanding it, fighting for it,

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.594
getting up every single day.

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:11.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
The opposite of justice
is not injustice.

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s indifference.
It´s inaction.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:16.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we as Americans
who believe this passionately

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:18.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
have to get engaged,
have to start pressuring,

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:20.773 size:84% position:42%
have to start pushing,
have to start fighting,

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:22.976 align:start size:94% position:6%
or else we´re gonna --
I fear we´re going to see this

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:24.711
continuing on a daily basis --

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:26.279
dozens and dozens of Americans

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
punctuated by these
mass shootings.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:31.251
It´s gonna continue to happen
till we stop it from happening

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:34.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
and pass reasonable gun-safety
legislation in our country.

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:36.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, best of luck.
I´m pulling for you there.

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:38.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thanks you so much
for being here.

